                <div class="smain-r c1">
                    						<h3 class="subitem-tit wow fadeIn">Application & Eligibility</h3>
                    
						<div class="text-block right-content">
														<h4>Nomination</h4><p>Applicants must be nominated by the home institution to be eligible for a place in the programme. First-year students are normally NOT eligible.<br>&nbsp;</p><h4>Grade Point Average</h4><p>Applicants are expected to attain a minimum cumulative GPA of&nbsp;2.5 on a 4.0 scale or equivalent.<br>&nbsp;</p><h4>English Proficiency</h4><p>Applicants who are not native English speakers will need to fulfil the following language requirements and provide documentary evidence when submitting their applications:</p><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-hover table-bordered"><tbody><tr><td>TOEFL&nbsp;</td><td>Internet-based: minimum <strong>80</strong> (For exams taken before January 21, 2026) or minimum <strong>4</strong> (For exams taken on or after January 21, 2026)</td></tr><tr><td>IELTS</td><td>Minimum overall band of <strong>6</strong> in the academic version</td></tr><tr><td>Home Institution</td><td>A letter/ signed declaration from the home institution’s International Office certifying proficiency</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Application (For students from Chinese Mainland, Taiwan, China and Macau, China please refer to Chinese version)</h4><p>Applicants are REQUIRED to complete the application online and submit the following documents to EdUHK via GEMS or mailing as appropriate before the deadline stipulated.</p><p id="isPasted">Documents Required – to be uploaded to GEMS:</p><ul><li>A scanned copy of official transcript</li><li>A scanned copy of TOEFL/IELTS scoresheet or English Proficiency Endorsement Form</li></ul><p>Documents Required – to be mailed to EdUHK:</p><ul><li>Visa application<br><br></li></ul><h4>Important Date</h4><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-hover table-bordered"><thead><tr><th>Apply For</th><th>Application Start Date</th><th>Application Deadline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Full-year</strong><br>September to June</td><td style="vertical-align: middle;">Early March</td><td style="vertical-align: middle;">Mid-April</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Semester 1 (Fall)</strong><br>September to December</td><td style="vertical-align: middle;">Early March</td><td style="vertical-align: middle;">Mid-April</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Semester 2 (Spring)</strong><br>January to June</td><td style="vertical-align: middle;">Early September</td><td style="vertical-align: middle;">Mid-October</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h6><br></h6><h6><em>Please note that late applications will normally NOT be considered.</em></h6>																				</div> 
					
												<div class="row mb-4 g-3 g-lg-4">
														<div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4"><div class="imtlist1"><img src="/gao/uploads/image/202211/5529f6b8f08a7d2456079bb66fe00d06.png" alt="Application & Eligibility"></div></div>
														<div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4"><div class="imtlist1"><img src="/gao/uploads/image/202211/5c94b097abd858d0e5694907bd9429fd.png" alt="Application & Eligibility"></div></div>
